{"chunk_id": "f162df292cbf", "text": "Shatrughna confronts the demon Lavana, refusing to let the Rakshasa escape once he has appeared for battle. Enraged, Lavana attacks with massive trees, hurling them like weapons, but Shatrughna shatters them with his arrows. The demon finally strikes Shatrughna senseless with a tree, prompting cries of alarm from sages, gods, and celestial beings who watch the combat. Mistakenly believing his foe dead, Lavana pauses to gather food rather than finish him. Shatrughna quickly recovers, returns to the city gate, and prepares a terrifying celestial arrow whose radiance shakes the entire universe. Alarmed gods ask Brahma if cosmic destruction is at hand, but he reassures them: the weapon is Vishnu\u2019s primordial power itself, destined to destroy Lavana and end the demon\u2019s tyranny.\nShatrughna battles the demon Lavana, recovers from a blow, and prepares a terrifying divine arrow of Vishnu to destroy him.\nThemes: heroic combat, divine weapons, good versus evil, cosmic fear, demon slaying", "vector": [0.005504525266587734, -0.011552372016012669, -0.001607042970135808, 0.013623785227537155, 0.004866122733801603, 0.017182540148496628, -0.03099648840725422, -0.020700547844171524, -0.03268078342080116, -0.016747884452342987, 0.007076761685311794, 0.016720717772841454, 0.010384230874478817, 0.003640253795310855, 0.01856801100075245, 0.008971595205366611, 0.03694585710763931, -0.019247163087129593, 0.021434031426906586, -0.018309932202100754, -0.016150230541825294, 0.014615346677601337, -0.0036334621254354715, 0.018771756440401077, -0.025019953027367592, 0.009297587908804417, 0.016163812950253487, -0.03254495561122894, 0.003925497643649578, 0.00215800479054451, -0.0069816806353628635, -0.0213253665715456, -0.0038372077979147434, -0.011036217212677002, -0.033957589417696, -0.020252307876944542, 0.0005619981093332171, -0.022507090121507645, 0.015538993291556835, 0.014031276106834412, -0.006268571130931377, 0.004512963816523552, -0.00740